# Golden frames of level 1's start: the whole screen as the frame ends
# ($7BF6: scenery, sprites and status bar drawn) at frames 1, 2 and 3 of
# play, with the scroll variables, the ship's object ($3921C, 64 bytes) and
# the game's variables from $C90 (score, shield, lives), and the list of
# 80 small shots at $3CF5C (x, y, dx, dy) and the 48 stars at $3D1DC
# (screen offset, bit, fraction of a line). Run with --trace fdc.
expect prompt read sector sector=0x1 .*tr=0x0 .*addr=0x6760e
stage golden-start-start.ini
stage golden-start-f1.ini
stage golden-start-f2.ini
stage golden-start-f3.ini
debug b pc = $7a50 :once :trace :file {run}/golden-start-start.ini
disk-a {disk2}
sleep 8
fire
sleep 4
fire
expect level1-read read sector sector=0x3 .*tr=0xc .*addr=0x3e
quiet level1-loaded 3
fire
sleep 2
fire
sleep 2
fire
sleep 4
